Revision history of I18N-CodeSets


0.00_00  2026-11-11  RC
    [ This version is entirely generated. ]

    + RdKw::I18N::CodeSets: the code sets of stdin, stdout, stderr,
      argv, env and filesys (by default, as Encode::Locale says),
      and the diag mode (unicode or ascii), from new or from -C
      specs (parse), and the process's own (locale).
    + initstd, to_fs, un_fs (as in RdKw::WwW::GenGenLib 0.01_00,
      but of lists, and with { prog => ... } for who could not),
      un_argv, to_argv, decode_argv, encode_argv, getenv, setenv,
      unsetenv: in and out of the process, or an error (FB_CROAK,
      unless { check => ... } says otherwise; decode_argv and
      encode_argv take it as Encode::Locale's do).
    + diag_name, diag: names for people, quoted to show what would
      not (according to the diag mode).
